comments.body:
The object is indeed at 41,52; however many of the descriptions here do not describe the exact location of the book well enough to find it (in fact some are downright misleading).

As you enter the temple, you'll see Warlord Krellian in the middle of the pool on an island.&nbsp; If you continue straight, moving directly across the room to the east and past the island. you will come to an spot between two small alcoves (recesses with ledges near the pool).&nbsp; 

The book is in the left alcove, on top of the ledge at the far end (closer to the entrance).
